  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CropIn is an Indian-based specialist in software for agribusiness. The company is using technology such as satellite images, artificial intelligence and machine learning to monitor crop health remotely, make yield predictions, and then pass on these insights to farmers. This in turn improves farmers&#x2019; access to finance and climate resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
